flowchart LR
  U[CLI user] --> C[CLI]
  C --> A[Authenticated XPC boundary]
  P[Other process] -.rejected.-> A
  A --> V[Vault protocol engine]
  V --> K[Keychain / Secure Enclave]
  V --> L[Per-device signed operation log]
  S[Sync provider / other device] --> L
  L --> Q[Deterministic validation and merge]
  Q --> E[Materialized entry view]
  Q --> R[Conflict / recovery view]
